# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and paste your Liveblocks PUBLIC key.
#
#   1. Sign in at https://liveblocks.io and open (or create) a project.
#   2. Project > API keys > copy the public key (it starts with `pk_dev_` or `pk_prod_`).
#      Only the public key belongs here, never the secret key.
#   3. Restart `npm run dev` (Vite reads env files at start).
#
# The public key ends up in the browser bundle by design: it only lets a browser
# enter rooms of that project.
VITE_LIVEBLOCKS_PUBLIC_KEY=
